# Dragon-Tiger Monitor Skill (skill-b7-lhb-monitor)

当用户想在盘后抓取 A 股龙虎榜、把营业部席位匹配成北向/机构/游资/量化/营业部标签、生成次日关注清单或区间统计时，读取并遵循 [SKILL.md](../SKILL.md) 作为本 skill 的规范说明。
详细调用声明见 `开发产物/SKILL.md`。

Use this skill when the user wants to pull the post-market A-share dragon-tiger list, tag broker seats as northbound / institution / hot-money / quant / branch, and produce a next-day watchlist or interval statistics. Read and follow [SKILL.md](../SKILL.md) as the canonical
instructions; the detailed agent-facing declaration lives in `开发产物/SKILL.md`.

## Workflow

1. Read `SKILL.md`, then `开发产物/SKILL.md`.
2. Read the references before changing any data logic:
- `开发产物/references/api_guide.md`
3. Run the entrypoints from the repository root:

```bash
python 开发产物/scripts/build.py --mode daily
python 开发产物/scripts/build.py --mode backfill --start 20250101 --end 20250630
python 开发产物/scripts/render_html.py
```

## Hard rules / 硬性口径

1. 席位标签来自标签库匹配，游资别名是民间观测映射、非券商官方身份、会迁移；输出必须带置信度并声明不构成对个人/机构的指认
2. 单边日（只有买方或只有卖方）必须正常出结果，不得抛异常
3. reasons/区间统计口径以 `开发产物/SKILL.md` 为准，不要自造统计口径

1. Seat tags come from the tag library; hot-money aliases are community observations, not official broker identities, and they migrate over time; output must carry confidence and state that it does not identify any person or institution
2. One-sided days (buyers only or sellers only) must still produce results without raising
3. Reason and interval-statistic definitions follow `开发产物/SKILL.md`; do not invent new aggregation rules

## Boundaries

- Data source is PandaData via `panda_data`; credentials come only from environment variables or `~/.pandadata/pandadata.env`. Never hard-code or echo credentials.
